			"date": "2026-02-06T23:18:45.850Z",
			"content": "<p>Totally agree. I think the ability to hyperlink any text in a post is a bug, not a feature, of Bluesky. Too easy to get people to click on things, thus we need a modal to explain where you're really going.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
