			},
			"date": "2026-02-07T03:18:18.829Z",
			"content": "<p>i think it's tricky, if 99.9% links in this context are completely predictable about where they're going, it can be easy to trust it too much. i don't think it's about being anti-web, just tricky design area unless they're completely forbidden</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
