			},
			"date": "2026-02-07T03:21:40.401Z",
			"content": "<p>so if the link goes to <a href=\"https://foo.com\">foo.com</a> but this function extracts <a href=\"https://bar.com\">bar.com</a> from the text of the link, then it would show a warning. i don't think it would warn if it's just an external link with \"bar\" as text.</p>",
