			},
			"date": "2026-02-07T14:03:09.462Z",
			"content": "<p>The <a href=\"https://go.bsky.app\">go.bsky.app</a> link shortener is also hostile, they need to get rid of it asap. Honestly, with the recent changes X is the better hyperlink handler which is a real shame.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
