		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3megrceg4ss2e",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3megrceg4ss2e",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2026-02-09T15:30:12.960Z",
			"content": "<p>Follow up here: thankful to folks educating in the replies, I’ve learned that the hyperlink text *shown* on Bluesky (similar to Fedi, too) can differ from the target URL and this modal is only shown when they differ.</p>\n<p>(for even more nuance: the post I encountered was a truncated link 🫣)</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:uthwv2jcpcccf4ec2bzsavg7/app.bsky.feed.post/3megta4owuk2w",
			"parentId": "at://did:web:didd.uk/app.bsky.feed.post/3meblbmpuwk2u",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/lukewarlow.dev/post/3megta4owuk2w",
			"author": {
				"name": "Luke",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/lukewarlow.dev",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:uthwv2jcpcccf4ec2bzsavg7/bafkreia3pmnk72btquz6ufuupstzrg7tb23smpinwmfntnk7lfl2gj7xae"
			},
			"date": "2026-02-09T16:04:45.215Z",
			"content": "<p>The mobile popup feels like a better UI, it at least explains it's because the link text is misleading.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3megthdypcs2n",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:uthwv2jcpcccf4ec2bzsavg7/app.bsky.feed.post/3megta4owuk2w",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3megthdypcs2n",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2026-02-09T16:08:47.776Z",
			"content": "<p>for disclosure, here is the original post (which has a truncated link): <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/humanwhocodes.com/post/3me7you7jan2k\">bsky.app/profile/huma...</a></p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:uthwv2jcpcccf4ec2bzsavg7/app.bsky.feed.post/3megtoss5ok2q",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3megthdypcs2n",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/lukewarlow.dev/post/3megtoss5ok2q",
			"author": {
				"name": "Luke",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/lukewarlow.dev",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:uthwv2jcpcccf4ec2bzsavg7/bafkreia3pmnk72btquz6ufuupstzrg7tb23smpinwmfntnk7lfl2gj7xae"
			},
			"date": "2026-02-09T16:12:58.164Z",
			"content": "<p>Oh interesting, there's two types of modal one is \"Leaving Bluesky\" one is the misleading link one. I think a popup when the URL is mismatched is fair. I think more generic one is odd, maybe it's because it's truncated?</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:web:didd.uk/app.bsky.feed.post/3megvcb7bj22s",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:uthwv2jcpcccf4ec2bzsavg7/app.bsky.feed.post/3megtoss5ok2q",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/ducky.ws/post/3megvcb7bj22s",
			"author": {
				"name": "Ducky 🦆",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/ducky.ws",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:web:didd.uk/bafkreibr5q2zthn3acjixunlnzuuoopsmcoxvn6vv7oid5t7fqlngnvn2y"
			},
			"date": "2026-02-09T16:41:44.549Z",
			"content": "<p>Yeah, it's because of the truncation. The code tries to find the domain in the text and see if it matches the domain in the link facet.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:wwv7b2hkcaghqlyy4mew2tzs/app.bsky.feed.post/3megvdbfdgc2b",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:uthwv2jcpcccf4ec2bzsavg7/app.bsky.feed.post/3megtoss5ok2q",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tbroyer.ltgt.net/post/3megvdbfdgc2b",
			"author": {
				"name": "Thomas Broyer",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tbroyer.ltgt.net",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:wwv7b2hkcaghqlyy4mew2tzs/bafkreihrqndj2znuvrww4i6apcquaupotcyo74imlxzlb7kihndwf7xhsy"
			},
			"date": "2026-02-09T16:42:18.308Z",
			"content": "<p>because <a href=\"https://humanwhocodes.co\">humanwhocodes.co</a> is a registrable domain on its own, so indeed the truncation makes the link misleading.</p>\n<p>And I suppose the truncation is due to <a href=\"https://github.com/humanwhocodes/crosspost\">github.com/humanwhocode...</a>, so Bluesky likely is not to blame here.<br>\n(can't check, github's having troubles 😅)</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:wwv7b2hkcaghqlyy4mew2tzs/app.bsky.feed.post/3megw62c2cs2b",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:wwv7b2hkcaghqlyy4mew2tzs/app.bsky.feed.post/3megvdbfdgc2b",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tbroyer.ltgt.net/post/3megw62c2cs2b",
			"author": {
				"name": "Thomas Broyer",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tbroyer.ltgt.net",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:wwv7b2hkcaghqlyy4mew2tzs/bafkreihrqndj2znuvrww4i6apcquaupotcyo74imlxzlb7kihndwf7xhsy"
			},
			"date": "2026-02-09T16:57:16.831Z",
			"content": "<p>And here it is: <a href=\"https://github.com/humanwhocodes/crosspost/blob/main/src/util/bluesky-facets.js#L199\">github.com/humanwhocode...</a></p>\n<p>All links to <a href=\"https://humanwhocodes.com/…\">humanwhocodes.com/%E2%80%A6</a> will be turned into <a href=\"https://humanwhocodes.co..\">humanwhocodes.co..</a>.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3megxfs2hhs27",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:wwv7b2hkcaghqlyy4mew2tzs/app.bsky.feed.post/3megw62c2cs2b",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3megxfs2hhs27",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2026-02-09T17:19:30.372Z",
			"content": "<p>oh dang, nice sleuthing! the truncation happened upstream!</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3megy35pjus2n",
