			},
			"date": "2026-02-09T17:31:27.240Z",
			"content": "<p>Another follow up here: <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:wwv7b2hkcaghqlyy4mew2tzs\">@tbroyer.ltgt.net</a> found the offending truncation code and it is not on <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur\">@bsky.app</a>’s part here. I’m sorry folks — I was far too harsh in my original post!</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/tbroyer.ltgt.net/post/3megw62c2cs2b\">bsky.app/profile/tbro...</a></p>",
